<p class=\\"local&nbsp;x\\" id=\\"&nbsp;anchor\\">a no-break space is part of a name</p>
<p class=\\"m_a>b\\">an unquoted value a name makes unsafe</p>
<p class=\\"m_byAttribute\\">a name only an attribute selector scopes</p>
